# Blog roadmap source of truth

When changing the blog, admin CMS, ad manager, AI generation, publishing, or related database schema:

- Read `docs/BLOG-ADMIN-AI-ARCHITECTURE.md` before implementation.
- Treat the architecture document and `blog-admin-ai-architecture.canvas.tsx` as shared source-of-truth artifacts.
- Update the affected phase status, decisions, schema, routes, security notes, and verification evidence.
- Update both the document and Canvas in the same task when a phase or meaningful sub-phase changes.
- Never mark a phase complete until implementation and verification are complete.
- Commit implementation and its matching roadmap updates together.
- Keep AI provider keys and service credentials server-only.
- Keep public Blog navigation in the homepage guide section and footer, not the primary header.
